1️⃣ Tab 1: Start the Python ML Service (Port 5001)
Navigate to your ML directory and launch the Flask server:

Bash
cd ml-service
python app.py
Expected Output: * Running on [http://127.0.0.1:5001](http://127.0.0.1:5001)

2️⃣ Tab 2: Start the Express Backend Server (Port 5000)
Navigate to your backend/server directory and run nodemon:

Bash
cd server
npx nodemon server.js
Expected Output: 🚀 Server running on port 5000

3️⃣ Tab 3: Start the React Frontend Client (Port 3000)
Navigate to your React client directory and start the dev server:

Bash
cd client
npm start
Expected Output: Opens http://localhost:3000 automatically in your browser!